%description:
Tests MSG_ZEROCOPY completions. The client sends with TcpSocket::sendZerocopy():
two SENDs of 300 bytes and one of 3000 bytes. TCP gives each SEND an id from 0,
as Linux does, and sends TCP_I_ZEROCOPY_COMPLETION when the last byte of the
SEND goes out, as Linux does on a device that copies the data: ids 0 and 1 with
A003 and A004, and id 2 with A008, the last segment of the third SEND.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 300; 1.0 300; 2.0 3000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.*_tcp.nagleEnabled = false
*.cli_app.zerocopy = true
*.cli_app.logIndications = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
cli_app: TCP_I_ZEROCOPY_COMPLETION, id 0
cli_app: TCP_I_ZEROCOPY_COMPLETION, id 1
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:301(300) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.001 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 301:601(300) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 601 win 16384 
[2.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 601:1601(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[2.001 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1601:2201(600) ack 501 win 16384 
[2.203 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2201 win 16384 
cli_app: TCP_I_ZEROCOPY_COMPLETION, id 2
[2.205 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2201:3201(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[2.205 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 3201:3601(400) ack 501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
